            "description": "Create a Razorpay order for wallet recharge.\n\n**Body:**\n- `amount` (required) — amount in INR, minimum 1\n\nReturns `orderId`, `amount` (in paise), `currency`, `keyId` — pass these to Razorpay SDK."
          },
