            },
            "description": "Razorpay webhook receiver — called by Razorpay servers automatically.\n\n**Do NOT call this manually in production.**\n\nConfigure URL in Razorpay Dashboard → Webhooks:\n`http://98.88.19.190:8000/api/v1/wallet/webhook`\n\nThe `x-razorpay-signature` header is added by Razorpay for verification."
